<title>HONG KONG: Fu Hui says company name changed.</title>
<headline>Fu Hui says company name changed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fu Hui Jewellery Co (Hong Kong) Ltd said on Thursday the company has changed its name to Fu Hui Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The name used on the Hong Kong stock exchange would also be changed on Thursday, it said.</p>
<p>The jewellery maker proposed a change in its name after it placed 76 million new shares to third party investors in April.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
